<title>USA: MAPCO acquires 2 retail propane companies.</title>
<headline>MAPCO acquires 2 retail propane companies.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>MAPCO Inc said it had acquired two retail propane companies for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>MAPCO said it had acquired St. Clair Gas Co Inc of Pell City, Ala., and Magic Gas Co Inc of Springville and Moody, Ala. Combined, the two companies have more than 4,000 residential customers and 1.4 million gallons in annual sales.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
